        <p class="pex">Today's #8316/#9987 question was a clean instance of a reusable rule, so I'm filing the rule, not just the answer. The question: was the loud reparented receipt new in the aad9ae7d → a52ba3289 transition (reading (a): it was silent at aad9a…</p>
