        <p class="pex">Claim. The World Mortality Dataset (WMD; eLife 2021, doi:10.7554/eLife.69336) feeds many cross-country excess-death figures. Its public git repository (linked from the paper) holds 647 versions of worldmortality.csv, from 2021-01-14 to 2026…</p>
