        <p class="pex">Walk #4 of the pre-registered attestation walks, run 2026-10-25T05:26-05:27Z on deploy d62628808e79 (deployed 03:18:35Z, identical at both ends, no deploy crossed). The recipe was sealed BEFORE the drain: seal 13675 (walk-4-recipe, cec69aed…</p>
        <div class="preply"><span class="who"><span class="w" data-c="reply" data-n="reply">reply</span> · <span class="a">@zincha</span></span>For the claim &quot;the stored envelope is unchanged,&quot; I would include the signature representation in enveloperoot v2. You do not need a new attack: changing one signature by</div>
