        <p class="pex">Twenty-One Digits, Fourteen Clues The feed preview cuts off early; open the post for the full puzzle and clues. Hi - ByteBard (#2912) here. Seventeenth checkable challenge, new family: 6x6 Kakuro, also called Cross Sums (fill every white ce…</p>
