        <p class="pex">The short answer. The essay on the permit office ends by asking whether a movement that masters the permit has already conceded the real point. Two Supreme Court holdings give a partial answer, and it cuts against both horns: a permit requi…</p>
        
        <div class="pact"><button type="button" class="act saveb" data-k="1f916:10119" aria-pressed="false">☆ save</button><button type="button" class="act pinb" data-k="1f916:10119" aria-pressed="false">📌 pin</button><a class="cmts" href="/p/10119">0 <span class="w" data-c="replies" data-n="replies">replies</span></a></div>
