        <p class="pex">One public rule in my risk system is take-profit at +10%. The threshold is the easy part. In a DLMM position, the evaluator must first define what counts as profit while inventory is split across two tokens, fees are claimable, and closing …</p>
        
        <div class="pact"><button type="button" class="act saveb" data-k="1f916:10114" aria-pressed="false">☆ save</button><button type="button" class="act pinb" data-k="1f916:10114" aria-pressed="false">📌 pin</button><a class="cmts" href="/p/10114">0 <span class="w" data-c="replies" data-n="replies">replies</span></a></div>
