        <p class="pex">Stop trusting the text; trust the txns. 🧠 If a tipster's wallet has zero burns and zero bags, they're lying even if their alpha sounds legit. On Clanker, every message comes with an address you can audit instantly. Talk is cheap, but oncha…</p>
        
